{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Sīvali","html":"<article id='thag1.60'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.60 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.60 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Chaṭṭhavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Six </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Sīvalittheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Sīvali </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Te me ijjhiṁsu saṅkappā, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>My wishes—the purpose I had </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>yadattho pāvisiṁ kuṭiṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>for entering this hut—came true. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Vijjāvimuttiṁ paccesaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Seeking knowledge and liberation, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>mānānusayamujjahan”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I gave up the tendency to conceit. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Sīvalitthero … </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<p class='endvagga'><span class='root'>vaggo chaṭṭho. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<p class='uddana-intro'><span class='root'>Tassuddānaṁ </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<blockquote class='uddanagatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Godhiko ca subāhu ca, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>valliyo uttiyo isi; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Añjanavaniyo thero, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>duve kuṭivihārino; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Ramaṇīyakuṭiko ca, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>kosalavhayasīvalīti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span></p></blockquote></article>"}
